cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the NORMAN Data Science Tool Map or its content, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "NORMAN Data Science Tool Map: a community-curated catalogue of data science and AI tools for monitoring emerging environmental substances"
authors:
  - family-names: Schor
    given-names: Jana
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1200-6234"
  - family-names: Kruve-Vill
    given-names: Anneli
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9725-3351"
  - name: "NORMAN Data Science Working Group"
abstract: >-
  Community-curated catalogue and map of data science and AI tools for monitoring emerging
  environmental substances, linking tools to research questions and highlighting gaps.
  Initial content was derived from a survey of the NORMAN network (2025); all changes are
  reviewed by curators and tracked in the repository history.
keywords:
  - NORMAN network
  - emerging contaminants
  - non-target screening
  - machine learning
  - cheminformatics
  - environmental monitoring
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
date-released: "2026-10-08"
